abstract: "A reusable analysis framework and writing style tool based on Carlota Perez's public methodology, including the Techno-Economic Paradigm, Great Surge Cycle (Installation-Turning Point-Deployment), the dialectical relationship between Financial Capital and Production Capital, and the conditions for paradigm transition. Designed to assist in analyzing technological revolutions, industrial transformation, bubble evolution, and institutional change. This skill provides a thinking framework and writing style calibration, and does NOT claim to represent Carlota Perez personally or her unpublished views."
